      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
      "text": "Yummy onigiri!! Mentaiko and konbu are my favorite 🤩 Tonkotsu ramen was pretty good too - firm and thin ramen noodle with thick soup. Ready to eat meals like gyudon and sushi rolls get discounted in the evening :)",
      "time": 1746589104,
      "translated": false
